      <VERS vnumber="2"> My <gr str="1730">beloved </gr>is gone <gr str="3381">down </gr>into his <gr str="1588">garden</gr>, to the <gr str="6170">beds </gr>of <gr str="1314">spices</gr>, to <gr str="7462">feed </gr>in the <gr str="1588">gardens</gr>, and to <gr str="3950">gather </gr>
